WEBVTT

00:01:49.370 --> 00:01:50.510
What's going on?

00:01:50.510 --> 00:01:51.700
Takao!

00:01:58.370 --> 00:01:59.490
What is that?

00:02:03.520 --> 00:02:05.210
Psykick's...?!

00:02:16.910 --> 00:02:21.610
We went to see a Beyblade tournament
as per Chairman Daitenji's invitation.

00:02:21.610 --> 00:02:28.000
What we saw there was a digital
Sacred Beast, wrecking havoc in the arena.

00:02:29.610 --> 00:02:33.700
Those scientists are up
to something unbelievable.

00:02:46.030 --> 00:02:50.260
So the scientists
turned tail and ran, eh?

00:02:52.160 --> 00:02:54.290
Some digital Sacred Beast!

00:02:54.290 --> 00:02:56.900
We were worried over a dud!

00:02:57.760 --> 00:03:00.590
Ignorance truly is bliss...

00:03:00.590 --> 00:03:02.100
What'd you say?

00:03:02.100 --> 00:03:09.100
If the digital Sacred Beasts are completed, then it
means the four might lose the way they are now.

00:03:09.800 --> 00:03:11.570
That's Ozma's point.

00:03:11.570 --> 00:03:13.660
Oh, really...

00:03:13.740 --> 00:03:16.360
Talking to morons
give me a headache.

00:03:17.360 --> 00:03:18.660
We can't keep this up.

00:03:20.030 --> 00:03:23.600
We need to make the Sacred
Beasts grow as soon as possible.

00:03:24.480 --> 00:03:29.320
And then we'll take
'em after they improve.

00:03:29.320 --> 00:03:30.720
Sounds great.

00:03:38.800 --> 00:03:40.690
It should be in
here somewhere...

00:03:41.860 --> 00:03:44.860
The reason why Digital
Dragon went out of control.

00:03:46.400 --> 00:03:48.510
Doctor, we found an irregularity!

00:03:48.510 --> 00:03:49.560
What?!

00:03:52.470 --> 00:03:54.370
What the hell
is this program?

00:03:54.550 --> 00:03:56.640
I don't remember putting this in!

00:03:56.640 --> 00:03:59.810
Delete it from
the program server!

00:04:00.490 --> 00:04:02.500
This is big! Big!

00:04:03.090 --> 00:04:04.370
Take a look.

00:04:05.730 --> 00:04:10.100
This is the analysis of the data
I recorded at the battle arena.

00:04:10.910 --> 00:04:14.630
And this is when I overlay
it with Seiryu's data.

00:04:18.160 --> 00:04:19.550
--They're a perfect match!

00:04:19.550 --> 00:04:20.740
What does this mean?

00:04:20.740 --> 00:04:22.500
They were copied!

00:04:22.500 --> 00:04:23.810
Copied?

00:04:24.050 --> 00:04:27.860
I'm certain they based it off data
they got from our battles with them!

00:04:27.860 --> 00:04:29.700
Can they do that?

00:04:29.700 --> 00:04:32.710
I don't know how they did it,

00:04:33.130 --> 00:04:35.550
To be exactly the same
down to the tiniest detail...

00:04:35.550 --> 00:04:38.000
I can only think that
they've been copied.

00:04:38.400 --> 00:04:39.610
On top of that,

00:04:41.830 --> 00:04:47.300
it's just a little bit, but the digital
Sacred Beast surpasses Seiryu in all the data!

00:04:47.650 --> 00:04:52.100
Wait, there's no way it's
stronger than Seiryu, right?

00:04:52.100 --> 00:04:53.560
It's possible.

00:04:53.560 --> 00:04:54.550
What?!

00:04:54.550 --> 00:04:57.220
No, it's not impossible.

00:04:57.410 --> 00:05:00.220
Yeah. That Sacred Beast from
yesterday was amazing.

00:05:00.220 --> 00:05:01.760
C'mon, Max...

00:05:01.760 --> 00:05:03.320
Was it really that amazing?

00:05:03.320 --> 00:05:04.930
For real.

00:05:04.930 --> 00:05:07.830
For real? How amazing is that?

00:05:07.830 --> 00:05:10.600
I can't really say "how"...

00:05:10.880 --> 00:05:12.180
But it was amazing.

00:05:12.380 --> 00:05:15.040
That doesn't help me at all!

00:05:15.040 --> 00:05:18.640
Aww, why can't I
see Sacred Beasts?

00:05:18.640 --> 00:05:22.400
Either way, we mustn't
underestimate them.

00:05:22.570 --> 00:05:25.600
The scientists are after
your four Sacred Beasts.

00:05:25.600 --> 00:05:30.810
I fear that they've made copies of
Genbu, Byakko, and Suzaku, too.

00:05:30.810 --> 00:05:33.150
To keep the Sacred Beasts in our hands,

00:05:33.150 --> 00:05:37.020
we need to improve
their abilities in battle.

00:05:37.020 --> 00:05:40.160
Okay! I'm definitely gonna
see a Sacred Beast today!

00:05:40.160 --> 00:05:41.870
Let's get to battling!

00:05:41.870 --> 00:05:43.190
Not quite.

00:05:43.190 --> 00:05:44.430
But why?

00:05:44.650 --> 00:05:46.650
In order to improve in battle,

00:05:46.650 --> 00:05:49.530
improving the Blader's physical
condition is number one!

00:05:49.530 --> 00:05:51.050
The battles come after.

00:05:51.050 --> 00:05:52.980
Aw, that's lame.

00:05:52.980 --> 00:05:57.510
Well then, gentlemen, let us begin
training with the special regimen I made!

00:05:58.100 --> 00:06:01.730
Let's do it guys! We aren't
gonna lose to no copies!

00:06:01.730 --> 00:06:02.610
--Yeah!

00:06:11.690 --> 00:06:15.250
You're too slow!
Pick up the pace!

00:06:15.250 --> 00:06:17.370
We can't run any
faster than this!

00:06:17.370 --> 00:06:21.480
Takao! Stop your
bellyaching and get to running!

00:06:22.470 --> 00:06:24.250
Where does she get off?

00:06:24.250 --> 00:06:25.630
What was that?

00:06:25.770 --> 00:06:27.360
Nothing!

00:06:29.170 --> 00:06:31.280
What the hell are they up to?

00:06:31.280 --> 00:06:33.950
Are they thinking the
same thing we are?

00:06:33.950 --> 00:06:36.750
Might be fun to just
see what they do.

00:06:36.750 --> 00:06:39.810
So we aren't going to battle?

00:06:39.810 --> 00:06:41.600
Lame...

00:06:51.290 --> 00:06:52.620
All done...

00:06:52.920 --> 00:06:54.940
So, we're going to battle next?

00:06:54.940 --> 00:06:55.590
Not yet.

00:06:55.590 --> 00:06:56.590
Not yet?

00:06:56.590 --> 00:07:00.000
Up next is pull-ups, sit-ups,
and back training.

00:07:00.320 --> 00:07:04.600
And training for
arm muscles, as well.

00:07:04.800 --> 00:07:06.310
That's a lot...

00:07:06.910 --> 00:07:08.320
Go, Shoot!

00:07:08.540 --> 00:07:08.750
--Just a little more, so keep it up!

00:07:08.750 --> 00:07:11.010
--Go, Shoot!

00:07:11.150 --> 00:07:14.290
Ninety-nine! One hundred!

00:07:15.420 --> 00:07:16.780
All done.

00:07:17.500 --> 00:07:20.400
Keeping this up sure is rough...

00:07:20.840 --> 00:07:21.930
Are they done?

00:07:21.930 --> 00:07:23.820
Yes. Next up is battling.

00:07:23.820 --> 00:07:25.530
Yay!

00:07:25.530 --> 00:07:28.510
I'm gonna see one this time for sure!

00:07:30.580 --> 00:07:31.830
Draciel!

00:07:32.300 --> 00:07:33.500
Driger!

00:07:41.000 --> 00:07:42.270
Go, Draciel!

00:07:42.270 --> 00:07:44.000
Don't lose, Driger!

00:07:54.480 --> 00:07:55.620
Draciel!

00:07:56.580 --> 00:07:57.700
Driger!

00:08:03.810 --> 00:08:05.510
Nice battle!

00:08:07.510 --> 00:08:09.270
Why...?

00:08:09.270 --> 00:08:12.010
Why can't I see them?

00:08:12.180 --> 00:08:13.760
Maybe they hate you?

00:08:13.760 --> 00:08:15.130
What do you mean?

00:08:15.130 --> 00:08:19.500
Don't you think Sacred Beasts
have their own tastes, too?

00:08:21.060 --> 00:08:24.530
Why do they have to hate me?

00:08:24.530 --> 00:08:29.190
What's wrong with me?
I do my homework...

00:08:29.190 --> 00:08:31.930
I work hard as class president...

00:08:31.930 --> 00:08:35.730
I'm cute and considerate, too!

00:08:36.270 --> 00:08:37.870
No way!

00:08:37.870 --> 00:08:41.010
There's no way the
Sacred Beasts hate me!

00:08:41.010 --> 00:08:42.940
So why can't you see them?

00:08:42.940 --> 00:08:44.800
W-Well...

00:08:45.620 --> 00:08:46.700
I got it.

00:08:46.850 --> 00:08:48.500
What is it, Hiromi?

00:08:48.500 --> 00:08:50.630
You're hiding it
from me, aren't you?

00:08:51.250 --> 00:08:53.120
Hiding what?

00:08:53.120 --> 00:08:56.760
Duh! Hiding the
way to see them!

00:08:56.760 --> 00:08:59.030
The way to see a Sacred Beast?

00:08:59.030 --> 00:09:02.460
There's a trick to it,
isn't there? There has to be!

00:09:02.460 --> 00:09:03.960
Not a chance.

00:09:03.960 --> 00:09:06.410
Don't play dumb!

00:09:06.570 --> 00:09:08.610
Show me!

00:09:08.610 --> 00:09:09.680
Hey, show me!

00:09:09.680 --> 00:09:11.580
Please, show me!

00:09:11.580 --> 00:09:13.390
Just show me!

00:09:13.390 --> 00:09:15.850
I guess we have
to show you...

00:09:15.850 --> 00:09:16.740
Really?

00:09:17.520 --> 00:09:19.380
I don't know if
you can handle it!

00:09:19.380 --> 00:09:21.680
I can! I'll do anything!

00:09:22.490 --> 00:09:23.410
Are you sure?

00:09:23.410 --> 00:09:24.210
Yes!

00:09:28.880 --> 00:09:31.940
Uhh, first, turn
and face the ocean.

00:09:32.570 --> 00:09:35.330
Now raise your arms high!

00:09:35.620 --> 00:09:37.130
Why my arms?

00:09:37.130 --> 00:09:39.700
If you don't wanna, it don't
make a difference to me!

00:09:39.700 --> 00:09:41.320
I'm doing it!

00:09:41.320 --> 00:09:42.320
They're up!

00:09:42.320 --> 00:09:47.000
Next! Put both index
fingers on top of your head.

00:09:47.000 --> 00:09:48.010
Like this?

00:09:48.290 --> 00:09:51.020
Stay like that, bend your
knees, and diligently...

00:09:51.020 --> 00:09:54.100
say "oh honorable Sacred
Beast" a hundred times.

00:09:54.530 --> 00:09:58.600
Oh honorable Sacred Beast, Oh honorable
Sacred Beast, Oh honorable Sacred Beast...

00:10:02.940 --> 00:10:04.600
Fooled you!

00:10:05.530 --> 00:10:06.800
So lame!

00:10:07.200 --> 00:10:08.420
Takao!!

00:10:15.680 --> 00:10:18.420
I swear I will see it this time...

00:10:18.420 --> 00:10:20.950
Kyoujyu, do something about her.

00:10:20.950 --> 00:10:23.000
What's wrong
with just watching?

00:10:23.000 --> 00:10:25.840
If you stare it's
gonna be hard to battle!

00:10:25.840 --> 00:10:26.770
Nuh-uh!

00:10:26.770 --> 00:10:28.310
It's fine, Takao.

00:10:28.760 --> 00:10:30.930
Hiromi sounds like she's serious.

00:10:30.930 --> 00:10:32.210
I am!

00:10:33.040 --> 00:10:34.670
Whatever.

00:10:34.670 --> 00:10:37.010
Just shut up and watch.

00:10:39.970 --> 00:10:41.960
I will see one this time.

00:10:42.370 --> 00:10:44.910
This is gonna be hard...

00:10:46.680 --> 00:10:47.840
Go...

00:10:47.840 --> 00:10:48.970
Shoot!

00:10:52.000 --> 00:10:53.170
Dranzer!

00:10:53.170 --> 00:10:54.400
Dragoon!

00:11:00.860 --> 00:11:02.500
They're out, Hiromi!

00:11:02.960 --> 00:11:04.900
Where? Where are they?

00:11:04.900 --> 00:11:06.290
Up there!

00:11:07.890 --> 00:11:09.100
Where?!

00:11:10.160 --> 00:11:11.490
Dragoon!

00:11:15.110 --> 00:11:16.630
Dranzer!

00:11:22.240 --> 00:11:23.060
They clashed!

00:11:23.060 --> 00:11:23.810
Where?

00:11:23.810 --> 00:11:25.090
Right up there!

00:11:25.090 --> 00:11:26.930
Where? Where?!

00:11:26.930 --> 00:11:29.120
Where are they?!

00:11:34.300 --> 00:11:35.700
They went back.

00:11:42.720 --> 00:11:44.770
Stay quiet!

00:11:44.770 --> 00:11:46.610
We can't concentrate!

00:11:49.620 --> 00:11:53.840
If you leave that circle then
you can't join us for practice!

00:11:53.840 --> 00:11:55.410
I know, I know!

00:11:56.760 --> 00:12:00.210
Treating me like
I'm some outcast.

00:12:00.210 --> 00:12:03.920
Sorry, Hiromi!
It's so we can train!

00:12:03.920 --> 00:12:05.610
I know!

00:12:05.760 --> 00:12:07.920
Okay, let's do it!

00:12:07.920 --> 00:12:09.850
Go, Shoot!

00:12:09.850 --> 00:12:10.870
Dranzer!

00:12:10.870 --> 00:12:12.990
Go, Dragoon!

00:12:12.990 --> 00:12:14.450
Go, go!

00:12:14.450 --> 00:12:16.100
Yeah, that's it!

00:12:16.330 --> 00:12:17.600
Get him!

00:12:18.160 --> 00:12:20.010
Not bad, Kai!

00:12:20.010 --> 00:12:21.010
Wow!

00:12:24.800 --> 00:12:26.190
Thanks for dinner.

00:12:26.190 --> 00:12:27.870
You've barely eaten anything.

00:12:27.870 --> 00:12:29.520
I'm full.

00:12:29.890 --> 00:12:31.320
Good night.

00:12:32.560 --> 00:12:34.400
I wonder what happened?

00:12:40.230 --> 00:12:43.320
I wonder why I can't see them?

00:13:16.290 --> 00:13:18.470
All settings have been input.

00:13:18.610 --> 00:13:20.430
Good! Let 'er rip!

00:13:25.090 --> 00:13:26.590
They will...

00:13:26.590 --> 00:13:29.040
They will battle this time!

00:13:35.760 --> 00:13:37.700
Go now, Digital Bird!

00:13:38.320 --> 00:13:39.810
Digital Dragon!

00:13:50.310 --> 00:13:53.360
What are you doing?
Battle! You must battle!

00:13:53.360 --> 00:13:55.500
Increase the battle variable to 500!

00:13:55.620 --> 00:13:57.990
But Doctor, if we do that--

00:13:57.990 --> 00:14:00.300
I don't care! Increase it!

00:14:13.940 --> 00:14:15.300
Step aside!

00:14:15.560 --> 00:14:18.410
I will make them battle!
No matter what it takes!

00:14:23.690 --> 00:14:25.050
They're stuck...

00:14:25.050 --> 00:14:26.130
Doctor!

00:14:26.130 --> 00:14:27.310
Shut up!

00:14:27.310 --> 00:14:30.410
Battle! They have to battle...!

00:14:42.980 --> 00:14:46.100
Damn! Set up the next Bey!

00:14:50.440 --> 00:14:53.200
One, two, three, four...

00:14:53.200 --> 00:14:55.780
Two, three, four...

00:14:55.780 --> 00:14:58.400
What's gotten into you, Hiromi?

00:14:59.680 --> 00:15:02.800
I decided to start
training with you today.

00:15:02.800 --> 00:15:05.120
Watching from the
sidelines gets boring.

00:15:05.120 --> 00:15:07.410
What a weirdo.

00:15:08.260 --> 00:15:10.100
So let's get to it!

00:15:18.820 --> 00:15:20.670
Go, Dragoon!

00:15:20.670 --> 00:15:22.100
Driger!

00:15:29.900 --> 00:15:30.990
Are they out?

00:15:31.630 --> 00:15:32.910
Right up there.

00:15:35.070 --> 00:15:37.300
Now, Seiryu!

00:15:40.290 --> 00:15:41.910
Byakko!

00:15:53.700 --> 00:15:55.780
This is a good pace!

00:15:58.670 --> 00:16:00.500
Time for the next battle!

00:16:00.500 --> 00:16:02.240
Kai! Max!

00:16:03.300 --> 00:16:04.530
Ninety-seven!

00:16:05.710 --> 00:16:05.780
--Ninety-eight!

00:16:05.780 --> 00:16:07.140
--I'm not giving up.
I will see a Sacred Beast someday!

00:16:08.070 --> 00:16:09.540
--Ninety-nine!

00:16:10.180 --> 00:16:11.300
One hundred!

00:16:13.470 --> 00:16:14.900
All done...

00:16:15.440 --> 00:16:18.230
You've been
working hard, Hiromi.

00:16:18.230 --> 00:16:20.300
It isn't easy for us, either.

00:16:20.770 --> 00:16:24.200
I'm proud of my
endurance, if nothing else.

00:16:24.330 --> 00:16:26.710
I can't let you
guys show me up.

00:16:28.300 --> 00:16:30.490
What now, Hiromi?

00:16:32.360 --> 00:16:33.390
Ozma!

00:16:33.970 --> 00:16:37.660
Is this how you
guys improve for battle?

00:16:37.660 --> 00:16:41.350
There's no way to tell if
it was any help yet though!

00:16:41.350 --> 00:16:45.740
Excuse you! I stayed up all night
making this training regimen!

00:16:45.740 --> 00:16:47.500
What do you want?

00:16:47.500 --> 00:16:50.480
I bet you're still
sore after I beat you!

00:16:50.480 --> 00:16:53.620
If you want revenge, I'm
down whenever you are, Ozma!

00:16:54.850 --> 00:16:57.010
Takao. Let me handle this.

00:16:57.170 --> 00:16:59.140
I still have a score to settle.

00:16:59.140 --> 00:17:00.860
Yusuf! Let's battle!

00:17:01.130 --> 00:17:03.920
Let's see how much
you've improved.

00:17:08.080 --> 00:17:08.930
Three!

00:17:09.460 --> 00:17:10.400
--Two!

00:17:10.580 --> 00:17:11.710
--One!

00:17:11.710 --> 00:17:13.610
--Go, Shoot!

00:17:16.290 --> 00:17:17.730
Vanishing Moot!

00:17:22.410 --> 00:17:23.810
Driger!

00:17:27.240 --> 00:17:28.910
Hiromi, they're out!

00:17:31.410 --> 00:17:33.220
Go, Driger!

00:17:34.290 --> 00:17:37.300
I'll blow you away!
Vanishing Moot!

00:17:40.230 --> 00:17:41.300
Driger!

00:17:45.590 --> 00:17:48.770
Looks like all that training
was a waste of time!

00:17:49.570 --> 00:17:50.590
Go!

00:18:01.170 --> 00:18:02.400
Darn it!

00:18:03.300 --> 00:18:04.740
What's going on?

00:18:04.740 --> 00:18:07.120
This isn't good.
He's getting beaten around.

00:18:07.120 --> 00:18:08.340
Byakko!

00:18:10.770 --> 00:18:11.920
Rei, you can do it!

00:18:11.920 --> 00:18:14.000
You can still win this!

00:18:14.270 --> 00:18:15.330
Byakko...

00:18:16.780 --> 00:18:18.660
I won't lose!

00:18:19.750 --> 00:18:20.700
What?!

00:18:31.090 --> 00:18:32.930
Not bad...

00:18:32.930 --> 00:18:35.620
He's fully taking
advantage of his power.

00:18:35.740 --> 00:18:38.490
Yusuf!
Don't let your guard down.

00:18:38.610 --> 00:18:40.090
Great Rock!

00:18:42.210 --> 00:18:43.180
What?!

00:18:44.930 --> 00:18:47.580
Go, Vanishing Moot!

00:18:55.640 --> 00:18:56.820
Darn it!

00:18:57.470 --> 00:18:58.600
Is he losing?

00:18:58.600 --> 00:19:01.260
We don't know where
it'll attack from.

00:19:01.260 --> 00:19:03.600
Byakko, you can't lose.

00:19:03.600 --> 00:19:04.630
Hang in there!

00:19:08.290 --> 00:19:09.790
End this!

00:19:11.630 --> 00:19:13.690
Byakko!

00:19:20.680 --> 00:19:22.980
Above you!
It's coming from above you!

00:19:23.920 --> 00:19:24.830
I see it!

00:19:25.020 --> 00:19:26.850
Is that his Sacred Beast?

00:19:26.850 --> 00:19:29.010
Byakko! Dodge!

00:19:30.100 --> 00:19:31.120
What?

00:19:32.390 --> 00:19:34.720
Now! Vulcan Claw!

00:19:49.490 --> 00:19:50.820
I won...

00:19:51.290 --> 00:19:53.300
He did it!

00:19:53.300 --> 00:19:55.030
Byakko won!

00:19:55.030 --> 00:19:55.040
--Kyoujyu! Max!

00:19:55.040 --> 00:19:56.500
--He did it! He did it! He did it!

00:19:56.500 --> 00:19:57.400
--She saw it!

00:19:57.400 --> 00:19:58.290
--He won! He won! Yay!

00:19:58.290 --> 00:20:00.210
--She saw his Sacred Beast.

00:20:00.210 --> 00:20:01.200
--Yeah!

00:20:01.490 --> 00:20:03.410
Good job, Hiromi.

00:20:03.950 --> 00:20:06.000
You saw a Sacred Beast.

00:20:06.400 --> 00:20:07.520
A Sacred Beast...

00:20:08.710 --> 00:20:12.200
Your feelings got through!

00:20:18.290 --> 00:20:19.590
Yay!

00:20:20.000 --> 00:20:23.170
I finally saw one!
I saw a Sacred Beast!

00:20:23.170 --> 00:20:25.170
Yay! I did it!

00:20:28.300 --> 00:20:29.700
They're good.

00:20:30.300 --> 00:20:33.520
I understand why the Four
Sacred Beasts chose them.

00:20:34.930 --> 00:20:35.820
Let's move.

00:20:43.150 --> 00:20:46.000
Doctor! The settings
have been changed.

00:20:46.500 --> 00:20:47.380
Doctor!

00:20:50.720 --> 00:20:53.300
He's scaring me, Bro...

00:20:54.160 --> 00:20:55.210
Here we go.

00:21:02.790 --> 00:21:05.650
Battle! Battle! Battle!

00:21:05.650 --> 00:21:07.600
Battle, goddammit!

00:21:22.320 --> 00:21:23.620
We did it!

00:21:24.000 --> 00:21:26.180
They are finally complete!

00:21:26.450 --> 00:21:28.820
My digital Sacred Beasts!

00:22:59.510 --> 00:23:03.370
Gideon's men have completed
the digital Sacred Beasts!

00:23:03.370 --> 00:23:09.150
Yuya Minami, Kai's classmate,
was chosen as their test Blader!

00:23:09.150 --> 00:23:10.770
Do you remember him, Chairman?

00:23:10.770 --> 00:23:14.390
"I do, but I don't remember <b><i>you, ya?"</i></b>

00:23:14.390 --> 00:23:18.010
Chairman! Get home, brush
your teeth and go to bed!

00:23:18.010 --> 00:23:19.820
Next episode is a must see!
